<body>
<div type="letter">
<pb facs="1361590" n="1"/>
  <opener><lb/>Viro Illustriss.<hi rend="sup">o</hi> et Doctiss.<hi rend="sup">o</hi> <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-119166895">Nicolao Bernoull<choice><orig><g ref="#j">j</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice></rs>
      <lb/><rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-102552517">Petrus Ant.<hi rend="sup">us</hi> Michelotti</rs> <abbr>S. P. D.</abbr> </opener>
  <p><lb/>Quandoquid<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> <date when="1719-10-12">heri</date> <rs type="lostletter">litter<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> pro Te ab Hono<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ratissimo <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-1089913338">Fratre</rs> Tuo ad me miss<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> ad meas
      <lb/>pervenerunt manus, non potui quin eas (etsi
      <lb/>germanic<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> lingu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> imperitus) inspicerem
      <lb/>nimir<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> ut vider<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> an de fasciculo meo ali<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>qua fieret mentio. Per ea, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> potui intelli<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>gere de meo fasciculo nulla fit in iis <rs type="letter">litteris</rs>
      <lb/>mentio, ideoque ambigo nond<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> <rs type="place" key="place_GEO-2661604">Basile<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice></rs>
      <lb/>ipsum me<unclear>um</unclear> fascicul<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> fuisse perlat<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>. Rogo
      <lb/>ut mihi ignoscas quod Tuas <rs type="letter">litteras</rs> obsi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>gnatas aperire ausus sim ob fin<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> Tibi indi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>cat<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>. En eas ad Te, uti jussisti <rs type="place" key="place_GEO-3178829">Clavenn<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice></rs>
      <lb/>remitto, Tibique meam <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_M3G2JA79">dissertation<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice></rs> com<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>mendo.</p> <closer><salute>Vale Vir Amicissime, et me ama obsecro.</salute>
      <dateline>Dab<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> <rs type="place" key="place_VER-repven">Venetiis</rs> <date when="1719-10-13"><choice><abbr>a. d.</abbr><expan>ad diem</expan></choice> 13 Oct.<hi rend="sup">bris</hi> 1719</date>.</dateline></closer>
<note hand="pers_DE-588-119166895"><foreign xml:lang="ger"><abbr>Empf.</abbr> den <date when="1719-11-07"><abbr>7.<hi rend="sup">ten</hi></abbr> <abbr>9bris</abbr></date>.</foreign></note>
</div>
</body>
</text></TEI>